<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="preload" as="image" href="/public/top-image.jpg">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/public/favicon.svg">
  <title>404 - Страница не найдена | Recomte.ru</title>
  
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/bulma.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/style.css">
  <style>
    html, body {
      height: 100%;
    }
    
    body {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    header {
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .error-container {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .error-content {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 600px;
      background-color: white;
      padding: 3rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    .error-content h1 {
      font-size: 4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
      color: #48c774;
    }

    .error-content h2 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      margin: 1rem 0;
      color: #363636;
    }

    .error-content p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
      color: #7a7a7a;
    }

    .error-icon {
      font-size: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: #48c774;
    }

    .error-actions {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .error-actions a {
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background-color: #48c774;
      color: white;
      border: 2px solid #48c774;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background-color: #3aa373;
      border-color: #3aa373;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(72, 199, 116, 0.3);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background-color: transparent;
      color: #48c774;
      border: 2px solid #48c774;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background-color: #48c774;
      color: white;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(72, 199, 116, 0.3);
    }

    footer {
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Header - matches main page design -->
<header class="section has-background-image" style="padding: 2rem 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="is-flex is-justify-content-space-between is-align-items-center">
      <div>
        <h1 class="title is-2 has-text-white mb-5"><a href="/" class="has-text-white" style="text-decoration: none;">Recomte</a></h1>
        <h2 class="subtitle is-5 has-text-white">Кемперы из Европы</h2>
      </div>
      <nav class="navbar is-flex px-5 py-2 rounded" style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7); gap: 2rem;" role="navigation">
        <a class="navbar-item has-text-white" href="/">Главная</a>
        <a class="navbar-item has-text-white" href="/caravans">Каталог</a>
        <a class="navbar-item has-text-white" href="/contact">Контакты</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- Error Content -->
<div class="error-container">
  <div class="error-content">
    <div class="error-icon">
      <i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle"></i>
    </div>
    <h1>404</h1>
    <h2>Страница не найдена</h2>
    <p>К сожалению, страница, которую вы ищете, не существует или была перемещена.</p>
    <div class="error-actions">
      <a href="/" class="btn-primary">
        <i class="fas fa-home"></i> На главную
      </a>
      <a href="/caravans" class="btn-secondary">
        <i class="fas fa-list"></i> Каталог
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Footer -->
<%- include('layouts/footer') %>

</body>
</html>
